    {
      "type": "youtube",
      "id": "yt:9BgeZofIafw",
      "title": "This Sam Prendergast Performance Has Got Everyone Talking",
      "author": "United Rugby Championship",
      "avatar": null,
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9BgeZofIafw",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T15:00:03.000Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/9BgeZofIafw/hqdefault.jpg",
      "source": "UC-S6cXyil4qbIPfb2hrcH4w"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxoe5cn5qs2l",
      "text": "This week's Substack looking at how much try-scoring is too much try-scoring.\nPlus notes on the All Blacks, Dalziel, and PREM crowd numbers.\ntheofffieldreview.substack.com/p/tries-plea...",
      "author": "Ben Coles",
      "handle": "bencoles.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreihnbnflj5pmzn2vw5tula7bf7hay7nsutvg5e7suz6y2bnoob5p2a",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bencoles.bsky.social/post/3mxoe5cn5qs2l",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T10:54:43.511Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreif4j3vgh3mxgwy32jluxb6kxj5pxvtkqv5723bbv33afubs2pe6eu",
      "source": "bencoles.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxn2g4scxk2l",
      "text": "If you're Ollie Sleightholme here, where there's so much time and space, are you... thinking about dinner? Planning a holiday?",
      "author": "Ben Coles",
      "handle": "bencoles.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreihnbnflj5pmzn2vw5tula7bf7hay7nsutvg5e7suz6y2bnoob5p2a",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bencoles.bsky.social/post/3mxn2g4scxk2l",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-11T22:28:02.221Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreifb3neln5j255wiel2jef4vv4atb5yylp5vx6tzhipnmmjxrhwkdy",
      "source": "bencoles.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxlnbibpud27",
      "text": "This week's Castore Player Spotlight shines on Sam Prendergast after an impressive first start of the season 💪\n1️⃣0️⃣0️⃣ metres carried\n5️⃣6️⃣ post-contact metres\n4️⃣ defenders beaten\n3️⃣ line breaks\n2️⃣ offloads\n2️⃣ try assists\n8️⃣ tackles\n#LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leinsterrugby.bsky.social/post/3mxlnbibpud27",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-11T09:00:07.993Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreihdinvjeckjtdjkfw43kfjzduu4gzaxdv4nywshek3cjejkfl6mau",
      "source": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxlkyzlszk2l",
      "text": "On Sunday mornings we share our notes from our feature match on Substack, including real-time screengrabs from our WhatsApp group throughout > jeffpagano.substack.com/p/leinster-v...",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mxlkyzlszk2l",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-11T08:19:36.787Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreicrybpvjz2bqdscifep2qigjw3hlvipy3byyz2wnanbcwxngf3txy",
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxkgc2pexl2v",
      "text": "⚡ Jimmy O'Brien crossed twice to go along with tries from Hugo Keenan, Jack Conan and Jamie Osborne as we marked our return to Laya Arena with a bonus-point win under the lights!\n📰 Read the match report: https://bit.ly/4dyOVSl\n#LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leinsterrugby.bsky.social/post/3mxkgc2pexl2v",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-10T21:22:31.382Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreigr6t3d3l77pxoudwnxyss3aejk3qbrsrrt6l6wgjsxnzocz4a5oq",
      "source": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxkf2f47xs24",
      "text": "To finish the evening on two positives at least;\n- Taine Basham in absolutely unreal form. Deserves a Cymru call-up without question.\n- Matty Young with a super assured URC debut. One missed high ball but other than that he was great. Ran himself into the ground.\n#LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/bafkreifwhig3c235gkfloyju2rzwylbbjo3sp6xo57fhnk2ib7ywn7i37i",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social/post/3mxkf2f47xs24",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-10T21:00:20.225Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxkekpuaiy2a",
      "text": "📊 | Here are the match stats from tonight's win over Cardiff, courtesy of Laya Healthcare\n#LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leinsterrugby.bsky.social/post/3mxkekpuaiy2a",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-10T20:51:34.510Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreihqtuqiad4dfv3d4pbgtn3kn4w4d5h4secs4eaw5jxk3xq5tkne6m",
      "source": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxkdf5np2k24",
      "text": "Leinster 29-5 Cardiff FT\nKept much tighter in the second half but to be brutally honest we could stay out there for a week and wouldn’t have scored.\nDistinct lack of accuracy, skill execution and pace to the attack.\nTough night.\n#LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/bafkreifwhig3c235gkfloyju2rzwylbbjo3sp6xo57fhnk2ib7ywn7i37i",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social/post/3mxkdf5np2k24",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-10T20:30:34.025Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxkdf46bi22o",
      "text": "That 2nd half was a bit of a chore but Leinster always comfortable.  Sam doesn't run he glides and showed some great touches, nice to see Coffey work well with him after Fintan & Caspar have impressed too. Joe Mc pick of forwards, good long shift for many elite players. On to Clérmont #LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mxkdf46bi22o",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-10T20:30:32.472Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxkdcay7gh2g",
      "text": "A bonus-point win on our return home 💙\n#LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leinsterrugby.bsky.social/post/3mxkdcay7gh2g",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-10T20:28:56.737Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreie3ejexabtm2lugiysltsnbw34bmny3atoj45k7jvbjrexgvf4eju",
      "source": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxkbpjj4y22o",
      "text": "Decent showing from Coffey #LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mxkbpjj4y22o",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-10T20:00:34.517Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxk7yhyqvc2o",
      "text": "Have to be happy with that.  Sam's kicking radar needed fine tuning but overall the attack looks well in full flow.  Fell asleep for the Cardiff try but we're good for this lead and need to push on for more.  #LEIvCAR #BKTURC",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mxk7yhyqvc2o",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-10T19:29:47.441Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxjjkbsuzs2w",
